---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/LayoutLongevity.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Food & Nutrition for Longevity – The Longevity Guide"
  description="What to eat for steady energy, gut health, and long-term vitality, explained clearly and rooted in Indian food traditions."
>

  <section class="g-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="g-eyebrow">Guide · Food & Nutrition</span>
      <h1>Eating for the next 30 years, not just today</h1>
      <p>You don't need a foreign diet trend. Traditional Indian eating patterns already hold most of what longevity science recommends, when the basics are done well.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="g-section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="g-label">01 / The Fundamentals</span>
      <h2 class="g-title">Four habits that matter more than any single food</h2>
      <p class="g-sub">Longevity nutrition isn't about superfoods or elimination diets. It's about consistent patterns that keep blood sugar steady, protect gut health, and supply enough protein and fibre every day.</p>
      <div class="g-steps">
        <div class="g-step">
          <div class="g-step-num">1</div>
          <div><h3>Protein at every meal</h3><p>Dals, paneer, curd, eggs, and lean meats support muscle maintenance, which becomes more important, not less, with age.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="g-step">
          <div class="g-step-num">2</div>
          <div><h3>Fibre and fermented foods for gut health</h3><p>Vegetables, whole grains, and traditional ferments like curd and idli batter support a healthy gut microbiome, linked to immunity and mood.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="g-step">
          <div class="g-step-num">3</div>
          <div><h3>Minimise ultra-processed food</h3><p>Packaged snacks and refined sugar drive inflammation and blood sugar spikes. Home-cooked meals, even simple ones, are consistently better.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="g-step">
          <div class="g-step-num">4</div>
          <div><h3>Eat with a consistent rhythm</h3><p>Regular meal timing supports metabolic health more than any specific food choice. Avoid long gaps followed by large meals.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="g-section" style="background:var(--bg-mid);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="g-cols">
        <div class="g-col">
          <h3>Everyday choices that add up</h3>
          <div class="sign-grid">
            <div class="sign-card">
              <span class="sign-icon">🍳</span>
              <h4>Protein at Every Meal</h4>
              <p>Add a protein source to every meal, not just dinner.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sign-card">
              <span class="sign-icon">🥦</span>
              <h4>Half a Plate of Vegetables</h4>
              <p>Fill half your plate with vegetables where possible.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sign-card">
              <span class="sign-icon">🌾</span>
              <h4>Whole Grains Over Refined Flour</h4>
              <p>Choose whole grains over refined flour most days.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sign-card">
              <span class="sign-icon">🥣</span>
              <h4>A Daily Fermented Food</h4>
              <p>Keep a fermented food like curd as a daily staple.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sign-card">
              <span class="sign-icon">🫒</span>
              <h4>Traditional Fats, in Moderation</h4>
              <p>Cook in traditional fats (ghee, mustard, coconut oil) in moderation.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="g-col">
          <h3>Worth cutting back on</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Sugary drinks and packaged juices</li>
            <li>Deep-fried snacks as a daily habit, not an occasional one</li>
            <li>Excess refined carbohydrates (maida-heavy foods)</li>
            <li>Skipping meals and then overeating later</li>
            <li>Relying on supplements instead of whole foods</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="g-callout">
        <strong>Not sure where to start?</strong> Pick one habit from the list above and build it for a month before adding another. Small, consistent changes outlast big overhauls.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="g-section" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="stat-row">
        <div class="stat-item"><span class="stat-num">20–30g</span><span class="stat-label">protein per meal is a commonly cited target for muscle maintenance (approximate)</span></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><span class="stat-num">25–30g</span><span class="stat-label">daily fibre intake often recommended for gut and metabolic health (approximate)</span></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><span class="stat-num">80/20</span><span class="stat-label">a simple rule of thumb: whole foods most of the time, treats occasionally</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="g-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Explore the rest of the guide</h2>
      <p>Movement, sleep, mind, and Ayurvedic wisdom.</p>
      <a href="/longevity/guide" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Back to the Guide →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style is:global>
  .g-hero { background: var(--bg-mid); padding: 4rem 0 3.5rem; }
  .g-eyebrow { display: inline-block; font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-soft); background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: .35rem .9rem; border-radius: 100px; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .g-hero h1 { font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.01em; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .g-hero p { font-size: 1.02rem; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 620px; }

  .g-section { padding: 4rem 0; }
  .g-label { font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink); background: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: .3rem .9rem; border-radius: 99px; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .g-title { font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.01em; margin-bottom: .75rem; }
  .g-sub { font-size: .97rem; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 2rem; max-width: 680px; }

  .g-steps { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .9rem; }
  .g-step { display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start; background: #fff; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem; }
  .g-step-num { width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent-deep); color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: .9rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .g-step h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: .35rem; }
  .g-step p { font-size: .87rem; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.6; }

  .g-callout { background: var(--accent-pale); border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-deep); border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0; padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  .g-callout a { color: var(--accent-deep); text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 700; }

  .g-cols { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.25rem; }
  .g-col { background: #fff; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.5rem; }
  .g-col h3 { font-size: .95rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: .85rem; }
  .g-col ul { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .55rem; }
  .g-col li { font-size: .87rem; color: var(--ink-soft); padding-left: 1rem; position: relative; line-height: 1.55; }
  .g-col li::before { content: '•'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--accent-deep); font-weight: 900; }

  .g-cta { background: var(--accent-deep); padding: 3.5rem 0; text-align: center; }
  .g-cta h2 { font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: .75rem; }
  .g-cta p { color: #D9E5D5; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .g-cta .btn-primary { background: #fff; color: var(--accent-deep); border-color: #fff; }
  .g-cta .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent-pale); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) { .g-cols { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .sign-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
  .sign-card { background: #fff; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem; }
  .sign-icon { font-size: 1.6rem; display: block; margin-bottom: .6rem; }
  .sign-card h4 { font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: .95rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: .35rem; }
  .sign-card p { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.6; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .sign-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .stat-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.25rem; }
  .stat-item { background: var(--bg-mid); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem; text-align: center; }
  .stat-num { display: block; font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-deep); margin-bottom: .35rem; }
  .stat-label { display: block; font-size: .82rem; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.4; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .stat-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
